      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PIEBALD (2) tends to drift back and work into the race, charging home into the minors two back before winding up late into third (24.23) in a Grade 5 at Bendigo last time. Has a good record at this journey. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. LEKTRA BILLS (6) found some support last start but struggled into fifth (22.63), beaten 5 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Can do much better this time. COMPARE BUBBLE (4) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey here having won three of six starts. Below best last time at Bendigo (24.25) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.25 lengths fourth. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. AZZURRO WREN (3) will run well despite no experience on this track.",
